environment.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.020
Robust upstream support.

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:27.600
We leverage Fedora's
active community

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:30.870
for rapid innovation
and development.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:33.090
Declarative deviations.

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:36.540
Any changes from upstream
