00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:49.350
Azure Linux will feel
familiar and easy to adopt.

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:51.390
Enhanced security.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:55.500
Azure CVE SLAs are inherited,
